ATTRIBUTION AND PROVENANCE

The domain modelled in this repository -- a mid-size payment service provider,
its payout queue, and its external payment rail -- is entirely fictional. It
does not describe, and is not derived from, any real organisation, customer,
partner, employer, or production system. Every quantity in this repository is an
explicitly labelled assumption invented for the project.

No real payment data, personal data, or credentials appear anywhere in this
repository, and none may be introduced. See SECURITY.md.

