THIRD-PARTY DEPENDENCIES

This project depends on third-party software, each under its own license. The
authoritative inventory is the Gradle version catalog at
gradle/libs.versions.toml, and a generated dependency report is published with
each release.

The module `lock-api` has zero third-party dependencies by contract
(docs/contracts/C2-java-api.md), and CI enforces this.
